e clear water is safe)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 54 348 cm .141176 .2 .258824 rg BT 16 TL/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 37 Tm (Avoid floodwater, swimming pools, spas, radiators, waterbeds, and water with chemical odors, oily films)Tj T* (or suspected contamination. Streams, ponds and wells affected by flooding require official guidance;)Tj T* (microbial treatment does not remove chemical hazards.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 54 321 cm .070588 .223529 .290196 rg BT 17 TL/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (During a public advisory)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 54 267 cm .141176 .2 .258824 rg BT 16 TL/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 37 Tm (Boil-water notice: follow boiling instructions for drinking and food preparation. Do-not-drink notice: use)Tj T* (an approved alternative for ingestion. Do-not-use notice: avoid use as directed, including skin contact if)Tj T* (specified. Wait for official clearance before resuming normal use.)Tj T* ET Q Q q .21176471 .3254902 .3764706 rg .21176471 .3254902 .3764706 RG BT/helv 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 345.88703 31 Tm[( |  Created By New Exodus LLC)]TJ ET Q q Q q Q
